BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event_316851291@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261016T164611Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Dublin:20261107T110000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Dublin:20261107T120000
SUMMARY:Monthly Social - My Goodness
DESCRIPTION:Cork Vegans\n**Connect with us:**\n**[Website](https://www.cor
 kvegans.ie/) \\| [WhatsApp](https://chat.whatsapp.com/GLVQxJC9qCFK4xGSUafw
 o3) \\| [Linktree](https://linktr.ee/corkvegans)**\n\nMeeting new people c
 an feel like a big step\, so this event is focused on making making it as 
 easy and accessible as possible for new and reconnecting members! Join us 
 for our monthly social event - this month\, this will be the at [My Goodne
 ss Cafe (Co-op)](https://share.google/f6DvZxjG0z5lNeDAn)\n\n**The plan:**\
 n\nWe'll meet at 11:00 am to grab someone food. We will aim to finish up a
 t noon but may also grab a drink after or take a short walk.\n\n**What to 
 bring:**\n\n* Just yourself and some spending money!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/corkvegans/events/316851291/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261005T102402Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261005T102402Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event_hqdnbvyjcpbrb@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261016T164611Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Dublin:20261113T170000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Dublin:20261113T200000
SUMMARY:Indoor Climbing at Awesome Walls
DESCRIPTION:Cork Vegans\nJoin us for some indoor climbing in Awesome Walls
 ! Shoes available for rent at the climbing centre. 🧗\n\n**Connect with 
 us:**\n**[Website](https://www.corkvegans.ie) \\| [WhatsApp](https://chat.
 whatsapp.com/GLVQxJC9qCFK4xGSUafwo3) \\| [Linktree](https://linktr.ee/cork
 vegans)**\n\n**Please note:** You will need to complete the **[Bouldering 
 Induction](https://awesomewalls.ie/cork-inductions/)**. Online booking onl
 y available 48 hours in advance\, after that you’ll need to call **02148
 67060** to book a slot.\n\nThose who have complete the rope induction can 
 also top rope! 🧗\n\n**The plan:**\n\nWe will meet at **[Awesome Walls](
 https://goo.gl/maps/xpm3XuzHSU43tSm97)** at 06:00 pm. We'll be climbing th
 ere for \\~ 2 hrs so we will aim to finish up at 08:00 pm.\n\n**What to br
 ing:**\n\n* Water\n* Plant-based food or snacks
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/corkvegans/events/hqdnbvyjcpbrb/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261005T150111Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261005T150111Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
